{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23420","headline":"嗟发落 · 白居易","name":"嗟发落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝亦嗟发落，暮亦嗟发落。\n落尽诚可嗟，尽来亦不恶。\n既不劳洗沐，又不烦梳掠。\n最宜湿暑天，头轻无髻缚。\n脱置垢巾帻，解去尘缨络。\n银瓶贮寒泉，当顶倾一勺。\n有如醍醐灌，坐受清凉乐。\n因悟自在僧，亦资於剃削。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}